'''Packed ice'''{{fn|Also known as '''compressed ice''' in [[Language#Differences between English variants|British English]].}} is a variant of [[ice]] that functions almost identically, but does not melt and is [[opaque]] instead of transparent. Like other types of ice, it can only be obtained using a [[Silk Touch]] tool.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Packed ice can be obtained using any [[tool]] enchanted with [[Silk Touch]], though a [[pickaxe]] is the fastest. Without Silk Touch, breaking it drops nothing. Unlike normal [[ice]], packed ice never turns into [[water]] when broken.

{{breaking row|horizontal=1|Packed Ice|Pickaxe|drop=0}}

=== Natural generation ===
Packed ice is found in the rare [[ice spikes]] biome, as well as [[frozen peaks]], and [[ice caves]].{{upcoming|Fourth Drop 2026}} It also forms [[iceberg]]s found in [[frozen ocean]]s.

Packed ice generates as windows in [[igloo]]s.{{only|bedrock}}

Packed ice generates as [[pile]]s (and in some houses or meeting points) in [[village]]s in [[snowy plains]] biome.

Packed ice also generates in [[ancient cities]] and in [[trial chambers]] surrounding [[stray]] spawners.

{{block distribution}}

