|Oxeye Daisy
|Output=Suspicious Stew
|shapeless=true
|foot=1
}}

=== Bees ===
[[Bee]]s engage in a pollinating behavior with oxeye daisies, increasing the honey level in [[beehive]]s and [[bee nest]]s by 1.

=== Breeding ===
Oxeye daisies can be used to [[breed]], grow, and lead [[bees]].

=== Bee nests ===
[[Oak]], [[birch]], and [[cherry]] trees grown from [[sapling]]s that are within 2 blocks of an oxeye daisy have a 5% chance to grow with a [[bee nest]] and 2-3 [[bee]]s in it.

=== Composting ===
Placing an oxeye daisy into a [[composter]] has a 65% chance of raising the compost level by 1. A stack of oxeye daisies yields an average of 5.94 [[bone meal]].

